{"id":61012,"ord":130,"n_segments":146,"prev":61011,"next":61013,"doc":{"id":"70980","title":"70980_Quinn Wilson oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Quinn Wilson","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/70980/","url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=70980"},"chapter":"Influences, later bands and reflections","title":"Favorite arrangers and lost scores","category":"reflections","summary":"Duke, Mundy, Budd, Sy Oliver; scores lost.","period":null,"year_from":null,"year_to":null,"words":137,"start":[186,6],"end":[187,10],"url":"https://thisismattmiller.github.io/linked-jazz-2026-transcripts/?t=70980#s61012","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Earl Hines Orchestra","focus":0,"leader":"Earl Hines"}]},"people":[{"name":"Duke Ellington","qid":"Q4030","n":2},{"name":"Sy Oliver","qid":"Q1138796","n":2},{"name":"Earl Hines","qid":"Q354883","n":1},{"name":"Fletcher Henderson","qid":"Q505559","n":1},{"name":"Jimmy Mundy","qid":"Q1689400","n":1},{"name":"Budd Johnson","qid":"Q349082","n":1}],"story":{"theme":40,"theme_name":"Writing and arranging: how musicians compose","community":80,"community_name":"Writing, arranging and composing: how the music gets made","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":186,"b":6,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"And in arrangers, you talked about Fletcher Henderson, and Duke."},{"p":186,"b":7,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"....Duke . Jimmy Mundy . Budd Johnson."},{"p":186,"b":8,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Do you have any of your scores?"},{"p":186,"b":9,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Sy Oliver."},{"p":186,"b":10,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Sy Oliver, right. That's another one. Did you have any of your scores?"},{"p":187,"b":0,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"I haven't got a one of my scores."},{"p":187,"b":1,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Whatever happened to those arrangements?"},{"p":187,"b":2,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"I lost them in moving, I guess."},{"p":187,"b":3,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"Well, did you, after Earl's band broke up, did you get your parts back, or did you just have the score, or --"},{"p":187,"b":4,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"No he kept -- I just had the scores."},{"p":187,"b":5,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"So he kept them?"},{"p":187,"b":6,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"I kept the scores."},{"p":187,"b":7,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"But he kept the parts?"},{"p":187,"b":8,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"Yeah, he kept the arrangements."},{"p":187,"b":9,"s":"MR. DE MICHAEL","x":"I wonder whatever happened to that book. I understand just a few things remain."},{"p":187,"b":10,"s":"MR. WILSON","x":"I'd like to know. I'd like to know what he did with that book."}]}